{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1000_null", "source_sha256": "c01f9901aa06ad650b314d5a929022d1574a5f17402b31fd5bd6359592e719d6", "ja": "コンコン、ガチャ", "zh": "咚咚，咔嚓", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "2b04ea728a2c6793e5c954e8879fca64c7bc216285eb5b537e1b5e2f0d6d55ec", "ja": "お疲れさまでーす……\nわ、もうみんな揃ってるね！", "zh": "辛苦啦……\n哇，大家已经都到齐了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "3a3cc7b4fafabd6faf3d25736f1813f225af8530a144626d8ba571149ce4d7e5", "ja": "本当！\n本日の主役、桃子ちゃんはっけーん♪", "zh": "真的！\n发现今天的主角桃子啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1003_049mom", "source_sha256": "c4173862efd078e3ff6e3ba9e5eb25158983fa8b1afe4f8a68e92e57f0e960c9", "ja": "春香さん、麗花さんまで……。\nみんな、来るの早すぎ！", "zh": "春香姐、麗花姐也来了……。\n大家来得也太早了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "a7108810d28682136e83473f00b3a3becba780a8e60050d21d0ca3fadd0bfb73", "ja": "うん！　ちょっと早いかな～と思ったんだけど、\nなんだか待ちきれなくて……えへへ。", "zh": "嗯！虽然觉得是不是来得有点早了～，\n但总觉得等不及了……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "d9a2a219c28f9d392b842dd52b866b5c39e595697dd0b88b8ca399435ab28236", "ja": "でも、仕方ないと思うわ！\nだって今日は……ねえ？", "zh": "不过，我觉得也没办法嘛！\n毕竟今天可是……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1006_null", "source_sha256": "9080637d5825bd8c2bb85e5ebccc6cc4f8aa63bf2fe43972dc8845bb38579046", "ja": "数ヶ月前……", "zh": "数个月前……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1007_p", "source_sha256": "8da359a77ca3d34800bf7f2fe157dfd519baa454d1a3aadfabbf411883e14dca", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま。\n今日のミーティングは、次の定期公演についてだ。", "zh": "大家辛苦了。\n今天的会议是关于下一场定期公演的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1008_p", "source_sha256": "2919cce1baf0c85e6ff1d6006b58e16719858d96d9aae872b0aa9152b07a0fca", "ja": "事前に伝えたとおり、今回の公演では\n桃子の新曲をお披露目する予定なんだけど……。", "zh": "就像之前说过的，这次公演预定要首次公开桃子的……新歌，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "a1b3f902be268e8655701195ef450dd177c2ce55aa5cb29021017a0f87ea7cd2", "ja": "？　だけど、どうかしたの？\nなんか歯切れ悪いね、お兄ちゃん。", "zh": "？可是，怎么了吗？哥哥，你说话怎么吞吞吐吐的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1010_p", "source_sha256": "c8b3a0ee1405f9986d5ffadfeb78a95cf4ad046a07ee6c17f668e779f057d322", "ja": "実は、今朝連絡があって。\n桃子に、舞台の仕事が決まったんだ。", "zh": "其实，今天早上接到了联系。\n桃子，已经定下来要接一部舞台剧的工作了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1011_049mom", "source_sha256": "7848a08eaf145f63738a4e863cdbba8ac44261805f2eb44db25a594ac92a99ef", "ja": "舞台って……もしかして、\nこの前言ってた？　キャストが女性だけっていう。", "zh": "舞台……难道是之前提到过的那个？就是演员全都是女性的那部。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1012_p", "source_sha256": "753822502c5a36ee0e2e43a6a52d580377204e35f70fe2c11f066181eb9debab", "ja": "ああ。十代のアイドルや俳優が\n大勢出演する、人気シリーズ作品の新作……。", "zh": "嗯。是由许多十几岁的偶像和演员出演的热门系列作品的新作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1013_p", "source_sha256": "c979154c81f23b455b5e38386a1bc503b6f7c8bb776a95e98a74cd76928f321a", "ja": "今回はダブル主演で、\n桃子は主人公のうちのひとりだ。", "zh": "这次是双主演，桃子是其中一位主角。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "d009232be651c9f18e657210dfed9774507ee0a4d4fb3cde7b4a3a3f293c032e", "ja": "ええっ、主演！！？", "zh": "诶诶，主演！！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1015_046rio", "source_sha256": "4314da3e38a6edd88af0d5280fbf460c89ba4a72d57cd82c26a0187a0ef54f46", "ja": "やだ、すごいじゃな～い！！\n流石、桃子ちゃんね♪", "zh": "哎呀，这不是超厉害的嘛～！！\n真不愧是桃子呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1016_001har", "source_sha256": "b760642c28c1b4476bb54bcfc3a808d04779aa09969f6bfe48ac4071d294f79f", "ja": "おめでとう、桃子ちゃん！\nみんなで、お祝いしなくちゃだね♪", "zh": "恭喜你，桃子！\n大家一定要一起庆祝才行♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1017_048rei", "source_sha256": "bde934a05796f87cb23f1b943262d2d1768aee4fc7d1e418087fdd4a9a7444e1", "ja": "うんうん！　桃子ちゃんがお芝居のお仕事を\nがんばって続けてきたからこそだね！", "zh": "嗯嗯！正因为桃子一直努力坚持着戏剧方面的工作，才会有今天呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1018_049mom", "source_sha256": "342c2d4d7df65ccfb25b988915e5af0add3729f52daadefe5da6cb36876dece9", "ja": "あ、ありがと……。あ、そっか。\n定期公演とスケジュールが……。", "zh": "啊，谢谢……。啊，原来如此。\n定期公演和日程安排……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1019_p", "source_sha256": "88fb5c276896d172d7325b58d564773a0750e38e759f906813e4b17ec107df56", "ja": "そうなんだ。舞台の稽古と、定期公演のレッスンが\n時期的に被ってしまうと思って。", "zh": "是这样啊。我想舞台排练和定期公演的课程，时间上恐怕会撞在一起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1020_048rei", "source_sha256": "054705a1bd5c0dc36d3aaf52f19f51e29b651421e17cbf8002d2f5a8328e51f6", "ja": "そっか、それは困っちゃいますね。\n桃子ちゃんは分身できないし……。", "zh": "这样啊，那可就麻烦了。\n桃子又不能分身……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1021_p", "source_sha256": "b29334f32584ac7569ba45ba06af0c7bf792d689d16549bd374ef2faf61736b4", "ja": "はは、それができたらよかったんだけどな！", "zh": "哈哈，要是能做到就好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1022_p", "source_sha256": "a05332c34bc0fd7f7ea8f1c1d924b028e4ef81849fc4c646e733d1781ac7f5f6", "ja": "どうする？　桃子。\n定期公演を次回に延期する、という手もあるけど。", "zh": "怎么办？桃子。也可以考虑把定期公演延期到下次，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1023_049mom", "source_sha256": "0f00c0709cb506565827fbf1dcee3ffec06a8bd211ef4f29f49044ecce7a806b", "ja": "でもその後は、ドラマのお仕事が\nあるって言ってなかったっけ？", "zh": "不过之后不是还有电视剧的工作吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1024_p", "source_sha256": "beb6687586b84d19b2a896735f9e2521ad59578ad3881788e6839745d3679974", "ja": "あ、そうだったな……。\nそうなると……ううむ。", "zh": "啊，对哦……  \n这样一来……唔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1025_049mom", "source_sha256": "91b0d0809c1926875e34f9a2027dd7de3e131dba4106e392375b778528aa6147", "ja": "桃子なら大丈夫だよ。スケジュール的に、\nそこまで無理な感じじゃなさそうだし。", "zh": "桃子的话没问题哦。按日程来看，感觉也没那么勉强。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1026_049mom", "source_sha256": "19ad7839fee1c84c728eb304191d6eed0540d78070f96b015300705f09bdf493", "ja": "それに、お芝居のお仕事で、主演だよ？\n断るなんて考えられないし。桃子、やりたい！", "zh": "而且，这是戏剧工作的主演哦？\n怎么可能拒绝呢。桃子想演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1027_p", "source_sha256": "a271e7b4d413d2bf7f75e3b534a1093b622266ab95c6a39b7594ef39a594bc67", "ja": "そうか……わかった。桃子がやりたいなら、\nその気持ちを汲むのが一番だよな。", "zh": "这样啊……我知道了。既然桃子想做，\n最重要的就是尊重她的心意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1028_049mom", "source_sha256": "260be30874e26d72e7b930e905f5062796261adf6c08288eac19a971bac12e8c", "ja": "そういうこと♪", "zh": "就是这样♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1029_p", "source_sha256": "d303eb84e9dbce1c3f00bc864266295cb94c9e8dc9be70d8ee97d5b29fee94bc", "ja": "定期公演の方は、なるべく無理がないスケジュールを\n考えてみる。みんな、桃子のサポートを頼んだ！", "zh": "定期公演那边，我会尽量想一个\n不那么勉强的日程安排。大家，桃子就拜托你们支援了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1030_043nor", "source_sha256": "82f37c64a39bde59c034c0d2d336effa6c4af7d7254120c83bd3d7302c3b8fef", "ja": "任せて！/ええ！/はーい♪/はいっ！", "zh": "交给我吧！/好的！/好——♪/是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1031_046rio", "source_sha256": "2df36b34dd6bcf9447ba44fd19651899046ba39c1d862a1ce50616abc6f726a3", "ja": "ええ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1032_048rei", "source_sha256": "d71ac305c4e9487027314263374bf5f4dc549f9ad0c2fe230e10af592cc72e4c", "ja": "はーい♪", "zh": "好──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1033_001har", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1034_043nor", "source_sha256": "435e5af1fcfc03489a4ef53a15b70270c075872d587da91c1bf513a44d0853c3", "ja": "（桃子、お芝居の仕事だし絶対気合い入ってるよね。\nアタシがちゃんと見ててあげないと……！）", "zh": "（桃子可是要演戏的，肯定干劲十足吧。我得好好看着她才行……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1035_046rio", "source_sha256": "a1f5c31d44b12538db3666fcc87dec6efbb4ef2146b15d08efedaa0f276534eb", "ja": "（桃子ちゃん、小さいのにとっても気を遣うし……。\n劇場では、お姉さんにたっぷり甘えてもらわなきゃ！）", "zh": "（桃子明明年纪还小，却总是这么替别人着想……在剧场里，可得让她好好向姐姐撒撒娇才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1036_001har", "source_sha256": "5d9570f4d60e5bb644b580c231ac5140a5b6b4af8c4d62af488a5089761b9a3a", "ja": "（桃子ちゃんだから、大丈夫だと思うけど……\nちゃんと見ててあげなくちゃ。せ、先輩として！）", "zh": "（因为是桃子，我觉得应该没问题……  \n但还是得好好照看她才行。作、作为前辈！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1037_048rei", "source_sha256": "d454d715c02c9f1eac3e7ea02b243b1a39272ee61989ad12671292a2a6a4bbdd", "ja": "私、桃子ちゃんのお芝居も定期公演も、\nすっごく楽しみにしてるね！", "zh": "我非常期待桃子的演出和定期公演哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1038_049mom", "source_sha256": "b2773d8a77eafb2c12f9a48b7a738b08e6e621d9c7ce392705cc79d004bbdea5", "ja": "ありがとう、麗花さん。期待してていいよ！\n桃子、気合いを入れてがんばるから！", "zh": "谢谢你，丽花姐。尽管期待吧！\n桃子会打起精神努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1039_null", "source_sha256": "e689c577533eea6b1c68cb1054a45ecdbde99c6e0e3865f34c81dcf1d1ac6451", "ja": "制作発表記者会見　当日……", "zh": "制作发表记者会当日……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1040_null", "source_sha256": "fa58af4f0361da4ef749bac0a00d6a1b0f2295a1d5c686590a1d817bd54d2cdc", "ja": "ザワザワ……", "zh": "一阵骚动……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1041_p", "source_sha256": "bea7f99ecc8d50971facea8151303faa77463bf05a91a4cbd24f20e2d44110a5", "ja": "（聞いていた通り、キャストは桃子と近い年の\n女の子ばかりだな。他事務所のアイドルも多い）", "zh": "（正如听说的那样，演员全都是和桃子年纪相仿的女孩子啊。其他事务所的偶像也有很多。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1042_p", "source_sha256": "f3566baebc841f03ef9d7929789c23f95e44c00aaa88748b3536c0f87d3abe25", "ja": "（記者会見と取材の後は、メディア向けの本読み。\nどちらも、桃子なら問題ないだろう）", "zh": "（记者会和采访结束后，还要为媒体进行剧本围读。两边的话，桃子应该都没问题吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1043_ririka", "source_sha256": "c11406800ead4c8e67e611a9c6efb3321570741b9ab8dd27b774699421d4268c", "ja": "今回、ダブル主演を務める凛々加（りりか）です。\nよろしくお願いします。", "zh": "我是这次担任双主演的凛々加（りりか）。请多关照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1044_049mom", "source_sha256": "a4549c31c4e25e06e26cfae82e85f6a998888cb4805a08c707df1cf340decdce", "ja": "同じく、ダブル主演の周防桃子です。\nよろしくお願いします。", "zh": "同样担任双主演的周防桃子。\n请多指教。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1045_interviewer", "source_sha256": "cb3496670df3f00940abcf4ccba369a72a8f43261048988a5d2be89af544169f", "ja": "ダブル主演として大抜擢されたおふたりですが、\nまずお話を聞いた時のお気持ちを聞かせてください！", "zh": "两位获选担任双主演，真是令人惊喜。首先，请告诉我们听到这个消息时的感受！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1046_ririka", "source_sha256": "262c75d35d616f0d971060481a7148acaa690c5c7facbbda8de1ad77b842ef46", "ja": "えと、すごくびっくりしました！\n私、舞台の仕事って初めてなので……。", "zh": "那个，真的吓了一跳！\n因为我还是第一次接触舞台工作……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1047_049mom", "source_sha256": "8c3c8d6e6a00eb217ae69b3a47b85fda9933ddc0dcc2dcfb251afaad9d0831e0", "ja": "声を掛けていただけて、うれしかったです。\nお芝居の仕事は、大好きなので。", "zh": "能收到邀请，我很高兴。\n因为演戏的工作，我非常喜欢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1048_interviewer", "source_sha256": "f2f05d218e2e7b780f90ec4aff8f187b156f62ac889c8266ef7b4d5d4c05af68", "ja": "大変人気のあるシリーズ、今回の舞台は\n学園との事ですが……作品の印象は、どうですか？", "zh": "这是个非常受欢迎的系列，听说这次的舞台是\n校园……你对这部作品的印象如何呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1049_ririka", "source_sha256": "d7c34cb32ca096b1955333117c043bc8e83f6b5b693955ebe11747093ec90741", "ja": "雰囲気があって、ステキだと思います！", "zh": "很有氛围感，我觉得很棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1050_049mom", "source_sha256": "98a33dc7fb32e8c293f19b7d56b357f47c0be7b683790bf54e33e86eb32e71d4", "ja": "過去のシリーズに比べるとすこしダークで、でも\nファンタジーな要素もあって。そこが面白いです。", "zh": "和过去的系列相比，这次稍微有点黑暗，不过也加入了奇幻元素。这一点很有意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1051_049mom", "source_sha256": "780365970a79d736851437fc3c0a87c41ab98f3d175e27c90b503da60b29274f", "ja": "主人公たちは、ペアで行動するんですけど。いろんな\n関係性を、楽しんでもらえそうだなって思いました。", "zh": "主角们会成对行动，不过，我觉得大家应该也会很享受各种各样的关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1052_interviewer", "source_sha256": "aee841cd8ef592806a45b316d247ae41480a676baa2b950c2c7ce9b0b4cf1fc4", "ja": "先ほどの取材で、演出家の方もまさしく\n同じ事を仰られていました。さすがですね！", "zh": "刚才采访时，导演也说了完全一样的话。真不愧是您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1053_interviewer", "source_sha256": "82b3605bfb41e64961a3237d58cfd5186f0ecda748bce59aa2c8dfddcfb86f9b", "ja": "周防さんは、アイドルになられてからもお芝居に\n精力的に見えますが……ご本人としては？", "zh": "周防小姐成为偶像之后，似乎也一直在演戏上\n倾注精力……请问您本人是怎么想的呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1054_049mom", "source_sha256": "0ea969e698144cb5ad3f774b9b8754869f0613b64ba37e2f36921ef821838d88", "ja": "あ、はい。お芝居は好きなので……。\nこういう機会に呼んでいただけて、うれしいです。", "zh": "啊，是的。我喜欢演戏……能在这种机会中受邀参加，我很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1056_null", "source_sha256": "2a280ef3a05a8d99f35c618edcd07b25b74c732ebd66f263713a9efbbf211a84", "ja": "記者会見　終了後……", "zh": "记者会结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1057_049mom", "source_sha256": "d0c46dd3e6a17c09dc761f86c6b35333a8049e7aa98ddd4045ba71f329ac9dc1", "ja": "ふぅ。\n記者会見、思ったより長かったな……。", "zh": "呼……\n记者会比想象中还要久啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1059_049mom", "source_sha256": "a1b2dabca31057594dc52e0c4fc939f7b20464f39115120f0d3f842d8e24a624", "ja": "あ、凛々加さん。改めて、周防桃子です。\nダブル主演同士、これからよろしく……。", "zh": "啊，凛々加小姐。重新自我介绍一下，我是周防桃子。\n我们都是双主演，接下来请多关照……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1060_ririka", "source_sha256": "c181dd224a9860d2285c3b8fd63401970a7632412c57a7df9bd51519213190b9", "ja": "……（ふいっ）", "zh": "……（扭头）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1061_049mom", "source_sha256": "5a9e0b7862d990cf6f9cade631cb11707e4c5ff05e8da24cbc894d333ca928e7", "ja": "……行っちゃった。", "zh": "……走掉了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1062_p", "source_sha256": "ff1c70c8fa048aa4fd3f7bda90d232cbba6ecbd7548c896dbfd7ad9cf4fb7b23", "ja": "桃子、お疲れ様。\n……何かあったのか？", "zh": "桃子，辛苦了。\n……发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1063_049mom", "source_sha256": "bc7385231d6309b36d3326e4659e34365bb261578b6bce9c809a86b99f3e813f", "ja": "あ、お兄ちゃん。\n別に。挨拶したら、無視されちゃっただけ。", "zh": "啊，哥哥。\n没什么。只是打了个招呼，却被无视了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1064_p", "source_sha256": "df5b0d8dad4d967301c0b0d7908d87f06b82503e4ea743c062200d18358d5fb6", "ja": "えっ！", "zh": "咦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1065_049mom", "source_sha256": "942f18efd6d61abf4a7e932d6ea57b3fa56e7bf53ba5d9d2a5d23cc886111472", "ja": "大丈夫。よくあることだし、心配しなくていいよ。\n桃子の手に負えないって思ったら、ちゃんと言うから。", "zh": "没事的。这种事很常见，不用担心啦。\n要是桃子觉得应付不过来，会好好跟你说的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1066_p", "source_sha256": "7493dad241d626ee0c84a10f5c2e71b56460e111a539a09dacc7a764e1010d27", "ja": "そ、そうか。わかった……。", "zh": "哦、这样啊。知道了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_159_1067_p", "source_sha256": "11a48ee34cf06fc690a6a6324f8a5bb503eb0e59774c9f13da786a755298c2fb", "ja": "（確かに平気そうな顔をしているけど……うーん。\nひとまず、暫くは注意して見ている事にしよう……）", "zh": "（确实看起来没事的样子……嗯——总之，暂时还是留意观察一阵子吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
